A steam power station uses the following cycle :
Steam at turbine inlet: 150 bar, 550 $^\circ$C. reheat at 40 bar to same boiler outlet temperature. Condenser at 0.1 bar.
Assuming ideal processes, find the—
(a) quality of steam at turbine exhaust;
(b) cycle efficiency;
(c) steam rate.
